{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "b7c1e2a4-3d5f-4a1b-9c8e-2f6a7b4d1e30",
		"name": "Educourse API - Mission FSD-20",
		"description": "=======================================================\nCARA TES REST API - BACKEND EDUCOURSE (Mission FSD-20)\n=======================================================\n\nLANGKAH 1 - SIAPKAN SERVER\n  Buka terminal di folder project:\n      cd C:\\Users\\ASUS\\Documents\\GitHub\\educourse-api\n  Jalankan:\n      npm start\n  Tunggu muncul dua baris ini di terminal:\n      [database] terkoneksi ke MySQL \"educourse\" di 127.0.0.1:3306\n      [server] berjalan di http://localhost:3000\n  Kalau muncul [database] gagal terkoneksi, berarti MySQL XAMPP belum jalan.\n  Buka XAMPP Control Panel lalu klik Start pada modul MySQL.\n\nLANGKAH 2 - PASTIKAN DATABASE ADA\n  Database dan 17 tabel dibuat oleh file schema.sql.\n  Kalau tabel belum ada, jalankan sekali:\n      mysql -u root < schema.sql\n  ATAU import schema.sql lewat phpMyAdmin (http://localhost/phpmyadmin).\n\nLANGKAH 3 - IMPORT COLLECTION\n  Di Postman: Import > pilih file\n  educourse-api.postman_collection.json > Import\n\nLANGKAH 4 - JALANKAN COLLECTION\n  Klik kanan nama collection > Run collection > Run.\n  JANGAN menjalankan request satu per satu secara acak.\n\nLANGKAH 5 - LIHAT HASIL\n  Di tab Test Results, tiap request akan tampil:\n    hijau  = semua test LOLOS (lolos)\n    merah   = ada test GAGAL\n  Buka juga tab Console untuk melihat pesan dari pre-request script.\n\n=======================================================\nURUTAN REQUEST (JALANKAN DARI ATAS KE BAWAH)\n=======================================================\n\nFolder 0. Setup\n  0  Cek kondisi data awal\n     Hanya GET /users, tidak wajib dijalankan.\n\nFolder 1-2. Users (tabel users)\n  1  Create User            POST   /users         INSERT\n  2  Create User Kedua      POST   /users         INSERT\n  3  Get All Users          GET    /users         SELECT semua\n  4  Get User by ID         GET    /users/:id     SELECT by id\n  5  Update User            PATCH  /users/:id     UPDATE by id\n  6  Delete User            DELETE /users/:id     DELETE by id\n  7a GET tidak ada          GET    /users/:id     404\n  7b POST kurang field      POST   /users         400\n  7c POST email duplikat    POST   /users         409\n  7d PATCH role ngawur      PATCH  /users/:id     400\n  7e DELETE dua kali        DELETE /users/:id     404\n  8a POST user sama         POST   /users         409\n  8b cek tidak ada duplikat GET    /users         200\n  8c delete sisa           DELETE /users/uid001  200\n\nFolder 9. Categories & Tutors (master data)\n  9a POST /categories       INSERT kategori\n  9b GET  /categories       SELECT semua\n  9c POST /tutors           INSERT tutor\n  9d GET  /tutors           SELECT semua\n  9e PATCH /categories/:id  UPDATE kategori\n\nFolder 10. Course Structure\n  10a POST /courses         INSERT kelas (JOIN kategori + tutor)\n  10b GET  /courses         SELECT semua kelas\n  10c POST /modules         INSERT modul\n  10d POST /materials       INSERT video (wajib content_url)\n  10e POST /materials       video tanpa URL, harus 400\n  10f PATCH /materials/:id  UPDATE judul saja\n\nFolder 11. Assessments & Questions\n  11a POST /materials       INSERT quiz\n  11b POST /assessments     INSERT konfigurasi penilaian\n  11c POST /assessments     untuk video, harus 400\n  11d POST /questions       INSERT soal\n  11e POST /question-options INSERT opsi kunci (is_correct true)\n  11f POST /question-options INSERT opsi salah\n\nFolder 12. Delete Bertingkat (FK RESTRICT)\n  12a DELETE /categories/:id harus 409 (dipakai kelas)\n  12b DELETE /tutors/:id     harus 409 (mengajar kelas)\n  12c DELETE /questions/:id  harus 409 (punya opsi)\n\n=======================================================\nKETIKA COLLECTION STUCK (MUNCUL 409 DI SLUG/POSITION)\n=======================================================\n\nFolder 9 sampai 11 membuat data yang akan menumpuk kalau collection\ndijalankan berulang. Folder 12 juga sengaja menyisakan kelas dan kategori\nyang masih dipakai, jadi kategori dan tutor TIDAK bisa dihapus lewat API.\n\nKalau muncul 409 di folder 9/10/11, bersihkan dengan:\n\n    mysql -u root < reset.sql\n\nlalu jalankan ulang collection dari awal.\n\nFile reset.sql mengosongkan semua tabel. Jalankan lewat terminal\natau salin perintahnya ke tab SQL phpMyAdmin.\n\n=======================================================\nVARIABLE COLLECTION\n=======================================================\n\nbaseUrl          http://localhost:3000   alamat server\nuserId           uid001                 id user untuk request by id\n\nVariabel berikut diisi OTOMATIS oleh test script tiap request create.\nJangan diisi manual:\n  categoryId, tutorId, courseId, moduleId,\n  videoMaterialId, quizMaterialId, assessmentId, questionId\n\nKalau server jalan di port lain, ubah baseUrl di tab Variables.\n\n=======================================================\nHASIL YANG DIHARAPKAN\n=======================================================\n\n35 request total, 0 gagal.\n  - request \"0. Setup\" hanya GET /users dan selalu lolos\n  - 34 request sisanya diuji penuh\n\nStatus code yang muncul:\n  200 = berhasil\n  201 = data dibuat\n  400 = payload tidak valid\n  404 = data tidak ditemukan\n  409 = bentrok (duplikat atau masih dipakai)\n\nPENTING: request dengan kode 400, 404, atau 409 di folder 7, 8a, 10e,\n11c, dan 12 itu memang ITU yang diharapkan. Request tersebut sengaja\nmenguji error handling, bukan kegagalan.\n\nContoh: \"7c. POST email duplikat\" menjawab 409 karena emailnya memang\nsudah ada. Itu bukti validasi backend bekerja.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "0. Setup - Cek Kondisi Awal",
			"description": "Cek data yang ada sebelum collection dijalankan. Tidak wajib, tapi berguna sebagai titik awal.\n\nKalau folder 9-11 pernah dijalankan sebelumnya, data dari run itu masih ada di database. Lihat bagian \"KETIKA COLLECTION STUCK\" di deskripsi collection untuk cara membersihkannya.",
			"request": {
				"method": "GET",
				"header": [],
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users",
					"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
					"path": ["users"]
				},
				"description": "Cek data yang ada sebelum tes, untuk melihat kondisi awal."
			}
		},
		{
			"name": "1. Create User (POST /users) - INSERT",
			"event": [
				{
					"listen": "prerequest",
					"script": {
						"type": "text/javascript",
						"exec": [
							"// Reset variabel ke nilai awal. Variabel collection di Postman",
							"// tersimpan antar-run, jadi tanpa reset ini run berikutnya",
							"// memakai id dari run sebelumnya dan bentrok.",
							"pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', 'uid001');",
							"for (const k of ['categoryId','tutorId','courseId','moduleId',",
							"  'videoMaterialId','quizMaterialId','assessmentId','questionId']) {",
							"    pm.collectionVariables.set(k, '');",
							"}",
							"",
							"// Membersihkan sisa data dari run sebelumnya. Urutan WAJIB anak",
							"// lebih dulu dari induk karena foreign key memakai ON DELETE RESTRICT.",
							"// Kalau tidak dihapus, run kedua akan gagal 409 pada slug/position unik.",
							"const base = pm.collectionVariables.get('baseUrl');",
							"",
							"const TABEL = ['/reviews', '/question-options', '/questions',",
							"  '/assessments', '/materials', '/modules', '/courses',",
							"  '/tutors', '/categories', '/users'];",
							"",
							"for (const path of TABEL) {",
							"    const list = await new Promise((resolve) => {",
							"        pm.sendRequest({ url: base + path, method: 'GET' }, (err, res) => {",
							"            if (err || !res || res.code !== 200) return resolve([]);",
							"            try { resolve(res.json()); } catch (e) { resolve([]); }",
							"        });",
							"    });",
							"    for (const row of list) {",
							"        await new Promise((resolve) => {",
							"            pm.sendRequest({",
							"                url: base + path + '/' + encodeURIComponent(row.id),",
							"                method: 'DELETE'",
							"            }, () => resolve());",
							"        });",
							"    }",
							"}",
							"",
							"console.log('Setup: data dari run sebelumnya dibersihkan');"
						]
					}
				},
				{
					"listen": "test",
					"script": {
						"type": "text/javascript",
						"exec": [
							"pm.test('Status 201 Created', function () {",
							"    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
							"});",
							"",
							"const body = pm.response.json();",
							"pm.test('Data user dikembalikan', function () {",
							"    pm.expect(body.id).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('userId'));",
							"    pm.expect(body.role).to.eql('student');",
							"});",
							"",
							"// Simpan id-aslinya untuk request berikutnya",
							"pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', body.id);"
						]
					}
				}
			],
			"request": {
				"method": "POST",
				"header": [
					{
						"key": "Content-Type",
						"value": "application/json"
					}
				],
				"body": {
					"mode": "raw",
					"raw": "{\n  \"id\": \"{{userId}}\",\n  \"name\": \"Budi Santoso\",\n  \"email\": \"budi@mail.com\",\n  \"phone\": \"08123456789\",\n  \"role\": \"student\"\n}",
					"options": {
						"raw": {
							"language": "json"
						}
					}
				},
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users",
					"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
					"path": ["users"]
				},
				"description": "Langkah 2 misi: INSERT. Menambah satu user baru.\n\nField wajib: id, name, email.\nField opsional: phone, photo_url, role (default student).\n\nid adalah UID Firebase berupa string, jadi wajib dikirim manual."
			}
		},
